WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:06.490
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and yesterday
I asked you to submit all your Game of Thrones

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:10.110
Questions so here we shall answer them. Just
last night I also found some new evidence

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.990
for an official Winds of Winter release date
so I’ll explain that first. Because it would

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:13.330
be a very very big deal.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:16.320
There’s a little bit of math and a little
bit of leaked information from an international

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:20.960
news site. They collectively say Spring 2015,
which I don’t think is going to happen but

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.650
the data science website FiveThirtyEight ran
their own stats based on known factors and

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:32.650
came up with February 2015 which will never
play out. And there’s an international news

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:45.960
site that’s supposedly called Book Keep
Library saying April 2015. But I can’t even

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.620
find their website so I can’t confirm where
they got April from.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:52.300
Five Thirty Eight is Nate Silver’s website,
they do statistical analysis to write their

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:55.070
stories. Because they’re actually using
real data to make predictions I tend to trust

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:55.260
them more.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.640
The reason I don’t think the book will be
done by February is because George RR Martin

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:02.210
would have to not leave his house and exceed
his average daily word count every day until

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:05.309
February next year. There’s no way that’s
going to happen. He will travel, he will take

00:01:05.309 --> 00:01:05.560
days off.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.640
The article was written in June and since
then he already traveled to the Ediburgh Book

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:09.140
Festival. If you’ve never heard him talk
about writing, he only writes when he doesn’t

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:13.189
travel. And during football season he takes
every Sunday off.

00:01:13.189 --> 00:01:20.189
I’d like to see the book by the end of Season
5, that would be June 2015, even that seems

00:01:20.229 --> 00:01:25.420
optimistic. I do think it will be done in
2015. It’s harder to predict because book

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:28.880
releases don’t work the same way movie releases
or tv seasons work.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:33.149
I don’t even want to think about book 7.
Dream of Spring was originally planned as

00:01:33.149 --> 00:01:38.689
the final song of ice and fire novel but now
he’s said that he might expand it and do

00:01:38.689 --> 00:01:42.719
an eighth novel. There would just be more
side characters and more plots going on around

00:01:42.719 --> 00:01:43.569
the main characters.

00:01:43.569 --> 00:01:48.200
I’ll do a separate Winds of Winter video
soon and talk more about such things. Be sure

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:55.200
to subscribe to get it.

00:01:56.030 --> 00:02:03.030
On to questions, Question Number 1 - 1 rebeccaam.PNG
The faces they use are cured faces. The first

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:16.580
time I read the book and then saw it on the
series I was a little confused. But the book

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:19.590
explains it much better. They’re worn like
masks. So theoretically Jaqen has the face

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:23.590
he was born with. We don’t know if that’s
the one we saw but yes, he could totally go

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:26.640
back to any face he’s previously worn if
he still has the face.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:30.490
It’s also important to note that if they’re
on a mission to kill someone or infiltrate

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:35.440
a place, they can kill a new person, take
their face and walk around as said person.

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:40.500
That’s why everyone is wondering if syrio
forel is Jaqen, I don’t think that’s the

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:44.420
case, Syrio was a water dancer. I’m hoping
Dan and Dave understand how much the fans

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:48.590
talk about this and at least include some
easter egg for it during the Braavos scenes

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:49.850
in season 5.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:55.680
Just to explain the new faces thing. If Jaqen
were on a mission and he needed a new face,

00:02:55.680 --> 00:03:01.930
he’d kill someone, then preserve their face
so it wouldn’t decompose and start wearing

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:02.110
it.

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.910
Like constructing a mask from someone else’s
face.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:11.910
Question 2 - 2 - John Smith.PNG

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:18.920
