4 - noel gallagher.PNG

00:05:30.909 --> 00:05:37.909
I saw a lot of questions about Jaqen’s whereabouts
during season 2. The simple answer is he was

00:05:42.949 --> 00:05:47.590
exactly where he wanted to be. He wanted to
go to the wall so he let himself be captured.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:51.039
