it in greater detail but I think that he placed

00:05:51.039 --> 00:05:52.590
himself in Arya’s path.

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:59.229
I don’t think it guarantees that Syrio and
Jaqen are connected, but Jaqen took an interest

00:05:59.229 --> 00:06:02.559
