as a Faceless person.

00:06:02.559 --> 00:06:06.490
I think it’s really a combination of circumstance
and design. Jaqen didn’t go to King’s

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:10.379
Landing just because of Arya, but once he
was there he saw her and called an audible

00:06:10.379 --> 00:06:12.340
on whatever mission he was on.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:17.569
Book 5 provides a few suggestions as to what’s
going on, so if you want to follow up on Jaqen

00:06:17.569 --> 00:06:17.900
read that.

